Package: VariantStoryBench
Type: Package
Title: Reproducible Variant Reanalysis Benchmarks
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(
      "Sounkou Mahamane", "Toure",
      email = "sounkoutoure@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")
    )
Description: Selects public dated variant transitions, compares complete result
    relations, and calculates explicit-denominator metrics for variant
    prioritisation. Small generated developer fixtures test transport and
    result contracts; they are not the research population.
